<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on</p>
<p>the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3991/96 Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7326/31 German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9493/00 Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4730/40 Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.75/76  Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8390/10   French Francs</p>
<p>		     1718.0/9.0  Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     126.70/80   Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.8166/41   Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.0976/48   Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5960/88   Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6240/50</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$339.20/50</p>
</text>
